What`s New?
- Simplified creation of metatools (the Vault is removed);
- First launch tutorial was added;
- The ENV button switches the environment. There are three environments: the sky, the modern art gallery and the swimming pool. Play with a change of scenery;
- Graphic Settings is added (Press ESC inside game)

